# Substance 3D Designer: generator and noise nodes (web documentation)

- Date of retrieval: 11 October 2026
- Scope: Texture generators > Noises and Texture generators > Patterns, as listed in the official node library.
- Official index: https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/docs/substance-3d-designer/using/substance-graphs/nodes-reference-for-substance-graphs/node-library/node-library
- Method: the official index was read first, then each node page on Experience League. helpx.adobe.com pages returned HTTP 403 to WebFetch, so the Experience League copies were used instead.
- Substance 3D Designer is not installed on this machine. Nothing below was run or measured inside Designer.
- Mapping status: every mapping is `documented_only`. The nearest Copernicus node is a documentation-level judgement, based on the local Copernicus notes in `/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-cop-designer/docs/cop/<name>.md` and on the names in `/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-cop-designer/inventory/cop_names.txt`. No mapping has been verified in Houdini.
- Wording: "exact" means the Copernicus node does the same job. "approximate" means it is the closest available node and differs in a documented way. "none" means no Copernicus node is a reasonable match.
- No node is invented. Every name below appears on the official index, and each section cites the page it was read from.
- Totals: 137 nodes written (89 under Noises, 48 under Patterns). Mapping judgement: 3 exact in purpose, 112 approximate, 22 none. All 137 mappings are `documented_only`.

## Noises (Texture generators > Noises)

### 3D Perlin Noise

- Category: Texture generators > Noises
- Purpose: Creates volumetric Perlin noise sampled from a Position Map input.
- Main parameters: Scale, Size, Offset, Distortion Intensity, Contrast, Enable Tiling.
- Nearest Copernicus node: `Cop fractalnoise3d`, approximate (Copernicus has no plain 3D Perlin node).
- Mapping status: documented_only
- Source: https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/docs/substance-3d-designer/using/substance-graphs/nodes-reference-for-substance-graphs/node-library/texture-generators/noises/3d-perlin-noise

### 3D Perlin Noise Fractal

- Category: Texture generators > Noises
- Purpose: Generates fractal 3D Perlin noise from a Position Map input.
- Main parameters: Scale, Size, Offset, Min Level, Max Level, Roughness.
- Nearest Copernicus node: `Cop fractalnoise3d`, approximate (closest fractal 3D noise, without the Perlin level controls).
- Mapping status: documented_only
- Source: https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/docs/substance-3d-designer/using/substance-graphs/nodes-reference-for-substance-graphs/node-library/texture-generators/noises/3d-perlin-noise-fractal

